{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "2b91f8da-dc58-87c9-a364-de92e5fd4965",
  "created_at": "2026-01-27T12:02:20-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Gino Cirelli",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:57:45-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. Good afternoon, almost, it's just about noon. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:57:53-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. I am calling about plow. City plow blocked in car, at my mother's house. Two days now, almost."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:58:02-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay. I'm sorry about that. Let me get some details. What's the address where the car is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:58:10-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "285 Marsh Street. In The Point."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:58:13-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "285 Marsh Street, in the Point. Got it. And when did this happen? Was it during the storm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:58:21-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, last weekend storm. Snow first, Sunday, then it turned to rain Monday. Plow came Sunday night, I think, and made big wall of snow at the front of the car. Then rain made it heavy, like cement. Is not possible to dig."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:58:40-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, that heavy wet stuff is the worst. So the car is parked on the street in front of the house, and the plow pushed the bank up against it. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:58:55-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Car is on street, on the curb side. Plow went by and left the wall. Is the car of my mother. She needs it Thursday for doctor."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:59:08-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thursday, for an appointment. Let me write that down. And you said you're her son?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:59:16-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. I am son. I live other place, but I come every day to help. I try already to dig, yesterday. One hour. Then I stop, because I hurt my back and is only half done."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:59:32-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that snow is brutal when it's soaked like that. Please don't overdo it. Let me read this back. Car plowed in on Marsh Street at 285, from Sunday night's plowing, heavy and wet now, and you'd like it logged. Did I get that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:59:51-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. Please log it. I want it is on record that city plow did this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:59:59-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll log it as a plowed-in vehicle complaint with the address and the note about Thursday. Is there a color or a make on the car, so the crew knows which one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:00:13-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is gray Honda. Small one. Only car on that side, in front of the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:00:20-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gray Honda, only one on that side in front. Perfect. Is there a number where somebody can reach you if the crew needs to check anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:00:32-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. 401-555-0177."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:00:34-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0177. Is that your phone or your mother's?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:00:38-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is her landline. But I am there all day. I pick up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:00:44-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Now, I want to be straight with you. The crews have been working through a big list since the storm, and a lot of the side streets in the Point are narrow, so they get these complaints a lot. I'd guess sometime in the next day or so, but it's a window, not a promise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:01:08-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tomorrow is okay. Today is better. I have time now, I am free, so I wait at the house. I have nothing else, only my videos."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:01:20-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Your videos?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:01:22-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. I teach myself to cut hair, from videos. Is hobby, for now. So I practice on my mother's hair, and she complains. But this is not important. The car is important."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:01:36-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, good luck with that. Okay, so let me say it all once more. Gray Honda, 285 Marsh Street, blocked in by plow snow from Sunday into Monday, medical appointment Thursday, callback at the number you gave. Anything I missed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:01:54-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Only please tell them it is the plow bank, not just regular snow. Is very high."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:02:03-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put that in the notes, plow bank, very high, heavy and wet. I'll send it over to the crew supervisor this afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:02:13-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:02:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care of that back. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
